* .nodeset seed above) AND the 1V/0deg small-signal AC stimulus this
* testbench measures rejection of. Vvss is a separate, unperturbed 0V
* source -- the ground reference vref is measured against. Same injection
* convention (and therefore the same PSRR sign convention) as
* sim/closed-loop-psrr; note the stimulus enters the block through the
* extracted vdd wire resistance below, not straight onto every device pin.
Vvdd vdd 0 dc 2.97 ac 1 0
Vvss vss 0 dc 0

